  # @param net_off_bottom_at character Date and time when the footrope loses contact with the bottom after haulback has begun, marking the end of \"sampling\" / \"fishing\" for the tow. UTC Date and time with timezone offset following in ISO 8601 (`YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS+00`). Timestamp is to seconds precision (no fractional seconds). (optional)
  # @param net_on_bottom_at character Date and time when the footrope initially makes contact with the bottom, marking the start of \"sampling\" / \"fishing\" for the tow. UTC Date and time with timezone offset following in ISO 8601 (`YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS+00`). Timestamp is to seconds precision (no fractional seconds). (optional)
